<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσχρῄζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσχημᾰτ-χρηΐζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>require</i> or <i>desire
			besides</i>, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυραννίδος οὐδεμιῆς
				π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ σοῦ προσχρῄζομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1055
				</span></i>
			: c. gen. pers. et inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσχρηΐζω ὑμέων πείθεσθαι Μαρδονίῳ</span> I
				<i>request</i> you <i>to</i> listen to him, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.140
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́</span>: c. inf.
			only, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί προσχρῄζων μαθεῖν</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1155
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				1168
			</span></i>: in poetry with inf. understood, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν ὅπερ προσχρῄζετε</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυθέσθαι</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> πεύσεσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					641
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				787
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				520
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1202
			</span></i>.</div>
